{"ID":"20240118151406-d5a8qxh","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240118151406-d5a8qxh","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151406-d5a8qxh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151407-7ozsobm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240119170126-efrsj64\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240119170126-efrsj64\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:271,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:271\u0026#125;","title":"030防葵","type":"doc","updated":"20240125165905"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151407-7ozsobm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151407-7ozsobm","updated":"20240119170118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛寒，主疝瘕，肠泄，膀胱热结，溺不下，咳逆，温疟，癫痫，惊邪狂走，久服坚骨髓，益气轻身。又名梨盖。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119170121-gjmc4nr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119170121-gjmc4nr"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】防葵味辛苦，性寒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119170123-mnsr6zy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119170123-mnsr6zy"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【效用】根为解热利尿，镇静药，治膀胱宿水，膀胱热结，癃闭，癫狂痫症。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119170125-o545n8m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119170125-o545n8m"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】主痃癖气块，膀胱宿水，血气瘤大如盆者，悉能消散。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119170118-we9pw6h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119170118-we9pw6h"}},{"ID":"20240119170126-efrsj64","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119170126-efrsj64","updated":"20240125165905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第30防葵，近年来已经很少用，这个防葵，本草经有些药，根本现在没有人认得了，没有人认得，那到后来最近的明朝了，我讲了，《本草纲目》，它想博，博到成笑话，成笑话不好，所以我们回头去看本草经，缺失的部份，以后我们只有说，退休了到处去逛，无意间发掘出来了，诸如此类的，现在很少用，那很少采药的师傅，认不得了，因为没有医生用嘛。没有医生用的时候就不采了，这个采药师傅，他祖父的时候可能认得，爸爸可能还稍为有点印象，到了他的时候因为已经没有中医会用了，就没有了，那这种药，它又叫做梨盖，用得不多，你跑到药房去，买个防葵，可能不容易买到，诸位看看这个内容就好了。这是防葵。如果是重要的药我们要加重。"}]}]}